Source: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: NVIDIA Process Metrics maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), g++, meson, ninja-build, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: NVIDIA GPU process metrics profiler
 NVIDIA Process Metrics collects CUPTI kernel activity, NVML device telemetry,
 and, when enabled, CUPTI performance-monitor sampling for profiled processes.
